[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12965.269, "timestamp": "03:36:05", "text": "谢谢您，小姐。谢谢您，夫人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12968.309, "timestamp": "03:36:08", "text": "斯普鲁特尔。谢谢。如果你需要，我会在这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12971.75, "timestamp": "03:36:11", "text": "能够收集那些鹰群。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12973.99, "timestamp": "03:36:13", "text": "我帮助过的供应商会非常感激。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12981.269, "timestamp": "03:36:21", "text": "好的，我会尽力的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12983.75, "timestamp": "03:36:23", "text": "巴尔多·鲍蒙特应该已经回来了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12987.51, "timestamp": "03:36:27", "text": "现在。他被黑巫师控制了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12990.07, "timestamp": "03:36:30", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12991.87, "timestamp": "03:36:31", "text": "哦，我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13007.349, "timestamp": "03:36:47", "text": "新鲜的。沙恩·巴德认为黑暗魔法是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13010.15, "timestamp": "03:36:50", "text": "答案。我认为布鲁克伍兹队发挥了作用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13012.309, "timestamp": "03:36:52", "text": "参与了他的失踪。打扰一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13014.63, "timestamp": "03:36:54", "text": "你有没有提到巴多夫？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13017.59, "timestamp": "03:36:57", "text": "鲍蒙特？哦，又见面了。真好"}]